# ==============================================================================
# MCM 2026 Problem C: "The Invisible Hand" - Project Git Exclusion
# Standard: Industrial Quant / Silicon Valley HPC Engineering
# ==============================================================================

# --- [1. Python Core & Environment] ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.pyd
.Python
env/
venv/
.env
.venv
pip-log.txt
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
# Numba JIT Cache
__numba_cache__/

# --- [2. C++ & Build Artifacts (High Risk)] ---
# 严防编译中间产物污染代码库
build/
cpp_kernel/build/
bin/
lib/
obj/
# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj
# Dynamic Libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
# Static Libraries
*.a
*.lib
*.lai
*.la
# CMake Artifacts
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
*.cmake
install_manifest.txt

# --- [3. Data Lake Architecture (Schema Preservation)] ---
# 物理意义：Git 只管代码逻辑，不管数据资产
# 策略：忽略所有数据文件，但保留目录结构
data/bronze/*
data/silver/*
data/gold/*
data/platinum/*
# 允许追踪占位符，确保协作者拉取代码后目录结构完整
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/metadata.json

# --- [4. Logs & Forensics] ---
# MCMC 采样日志通常巨大，且含运行环境信息，不宜提交
logs/
*.log

# --- [5. Reports & Generated Assets] ---
# 忽略自动生成的图表和临时 TeX 表格
reports/figures/*
reports/mechanism_audit/*.json
reports/mechanism_audit/*.tex
reports/final_design/*.json
reports/final_design/*.tex
# 保留目录结构
!reports/**/.gitkeep

# --- [6. Auto-Generated Documentation] ---
# 由 exporter.py 生成的附录，每次运行都会变，无需版本控制
Code_Appendix.md
appendix_code.tex

# --- [7. IDE & System Noise] ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp

# --- [8. LaTeX Build Junk] ---
# 编译主论文时产生的临时文件
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.out
*.xdv
*.bbl
*.blg